            </note>
            <note corresp="#d188-f2" n="48" xml:id="d188-f2-content">
                <p><ref target="frus1924v02#pg_68"><hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>,
                        1924, vol. <hi rendition="#small-caps">ii</hi>, p. 68</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d188-f3" n="49" xml:id="d188-f3-content">
                <p>Treaty of alliance and protocol between Great Britain and Iraq, signed Oct. 10,
                    1922, and Apr. 30, 1923, League of Nations, <hi rendition="#italic">Treaty
                        Series</hi>, vol. 35, p. 13; and four subsidiary agreements signed Mar. 25,
                    1924, <hi rendition="#italic">ibid.</hi>, pp. 35, 103, 131, and 145.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
